# Secrets for `kamal ... -d production`. Only references live here, never values.
# Every value is read from an environment variable of the same name:
# - CI: the GitHub `production` environment secrets.
# - Laptop: export them in your shell first, e.g. from your password manager (see
#   docs/spec/infrastructure.md#kamal).
# Staging and production never share a value: these are not the staging secrets.
KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=$KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD
SECRET_KEY_BASE=$SECRET_KEY_BASE
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=$POSTGRES_PASSWORD
